    # Catch-all for ``answer <anything-but-a-wise-man>``. Custom-action
    # routing is longest-match-first, so the specific Answer_Wise_Man above
    # always wins for the correct phrasing; this fallback only fires when
    # the player guessed wrong. While the riddle is on the table, that's a
    # fatal mistake: the dragon eats them.
